# The island's context menu over a card (decision 066).

scenario: a menu opens only over the shown card
panel shelf files 3
menu shelf                          -> menu=none
tile shelf
menu other                          -> menu=none
menu shelf                          -> Expanded menu=shelf

scenario: Esc closes the menu first, then the selection, then the card
panel shelf files 3
tile shelf
choose shelf a
menu shelf                          -> menu=shelf chosen=a
esc                                 -> Expanded menu=none chosen=a
esc                                 -> Expanded chosen=none
esc                                 -> Idle

scenario: chosen or closed, it goes; the card stays
panel shelf files 3
tile shelf
menu shelf
menu-close                          -> Expanded menu=none

scenario: a question over the card closes it
panel shelf files 3
tile shelf
menu shelf
ask shelf                           -> dialog=shelf menu=none

scenario: it goes with its card
panel shelf files 3
panel other
tile shelf
menu shelf                          -> menu=shelf
home                                -> menu=none
